{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/About_Game.jpg?t=1751285978\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">EXON is fast, violent, and unrelenting. You'll need to master every weapon, power, and movement tool at your disposal to survive the onslaught. Precision and aggression are your only lifelines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/gif_shotgun_hvga_320_30.gif?t=1751285978\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your enemies don't wield guns\u2014they conjure storms of forbidden power and strike with brutal, unholy force. Every encounter is a deadly clash of brutality and chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/Gameplay.jpg?t=1751285978\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adapt or perish. Learn to command your arsenal, unleash devastating abilities, and use the environment to your advantage. Victory isn\u2019t given\u2014it\u2019s taken by force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/extras/gif_rifle_hvga_320_30.gif?t=1751285978\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Augment your body and bend the battlefield to your will. Each enhancement fuels your rampage, turning you into the apex predator of this broken world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3356980?t=1751285978","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3356980/page_bg_r